---
// Proof section — 2 real rtk gain screenshots from a happy developer
---
<section class="proof-section" id="proof">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-viking reveal">
      <img src="/assets/illustrations/viking-proof.webp" alt="Viking king on throne with 88.9% holographic display" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1047">
    </div>
    <h2 class="reveal" data-i18n="proof.title">Real-world savings</h2>
    <p class="section-sub reveal" data-i18n-html="proof.sub">Actual <code>rtk gain</code> output from a happy developer.</p>

    <div class="proof-row reveal">
      <div class="proof-text">
        <h3 data-i18n="proof.h1">A developer's feedback</h3>
        <p data-i18n-html="proof.d1">After a few weeks of daily use: 15,720 commands processed, 138M tokens saved. Just run <code>rtk gain</code> to see yours.</p>
        <span class="metric metric-green">88.9% efficiency</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-img">
        <img src="/assets/screenshots/rtkgain02.webp" alt="rtk gain dashboard showing 88.9% efficiency" loading="lazy" width="1370" height="840">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proof-row proof-row-reverse reveal">
      <div class="proof-text">
        <h3 data-i18n="proof.h2">Detailed breakdown</h3>
        <p data-i18n="proof.d2">Daily, weekly, and monthly stats by command. Track your savings over time.</p>
        <span class="metric metric-cyan">Per-command analytics</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-img">
        <img src="/assets/screenshots/rtkgain01.webp" alt="rtk gain daily and weekly breakdown" loading="lazy" width="609" height="967">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.proof-section { background: var(--bg-alt); }

.proof-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 56px;
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.proof-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.proof-row-reverse { flex-direction: row-reverse; }

.proof-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }

.proof-text h3 {
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  color: var(--text-bright);
}

.proof-text p {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
}

.proof-img {
  flex: 1.2;
  min-width: 0;
  max-width: 560px;
}

.proof-img img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  box-shadow:
    0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
    0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.proof-img img:hover {
  transform: scale(1.03);
  box-shadow:
    0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
    0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.15),
    0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .proof-row, .proof-row-reverse { flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
  .proof-img { max-width: 100%; }
}

.proof-viking {
  text-align: center;
  margin: 48px 0;
}
.proof-viking img {
  max-width: 560px;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,153,0.2);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 60px rgba(0,229,153,0.08);
}
</style>
